<title>POLAND: Komunalny Q1 net rises to PLN 2.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Komunalny Q1 net rises to PLN 2.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Komunalny preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     3.11    vs   2.47</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 3.11    vs   2.47</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.09    vs   1.72</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues   10.86    vs   7.06</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 6.55    vs   4.59</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   0.70    vs   0.34</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  0.01    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.02    vs   0.75</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
